== Emoji

Emoji are usually inserted directly as Unicode characters:

- Great work 🚀
- Done ✅
- Warning ⚠️
- Dashboard 📊

== Unicode symbols without sym

You can also type symbols directly: ✓ ✗ → ← ★ § ¶

== Summary

- Built-in symbols: #sym.checkmark, #sym.arrow.r, #sym.star
- Emoji: type directly, e.g. 🚀 ✅ 📊

== Symbols with #sym

- sym.ZZ : #sym.ZZ
- arrow right : #sym.arrow.r
- arrow quad : #sym.arrow.quad

== Emoji with #sym

- child : #emoji.child
- rocket : #emoji.rocket
- airplane : #emoji.airplane


== Faces

- smile : #emoji.face.smile
- frown : #emoji.face.frown
- dancing : #emoji.dancing.woman

== Size

#text(size: 24pt)[#emoji.face.smile]

#text(size: 32pt)[#emoji.face.frown]

- smile: #text(size: 24pt)[#emoji.face.smile]

- frown: #text(size: 24pt)[#emoji.face.frown]

== Import

#import emoji: face

- smile: #text(size: 24pt)[#face.smile]
- frown: #text(size: 24pt)[#face.frown]


